According to TSL aiming, the addition keeps the Model Y total at the numerically notable figure of 400 pony.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:19.500
Particle level control remains the decisive factor in dry cathode yields.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:26.980
In-house material lets Tesla specify a particle shape and surface chemistry that third-party powders cannot match.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:32.780
Vendor powders were formulated for solvent heavy slurries that demand large energy intensive

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:33.720
