00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:20.680
According to Inside EVs, the shared platform approach reduces development cost while meeting

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:26.480
city range requirements. The issue surfaces directly before a scheduled EU-level review

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:31.680
of assisted driving software. Battery cathode production was long viewed as a commodity

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:37.060
step that any large manufacturer could source from Asia. The actual constraint lies at

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:41.940
the particle scale where shape, density, and surface chemistry determine whether a dry electrode

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:47.400
process holds together during calendaring. Testless synthesis inside Giga-Texas lets

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:52.480
engineers tune those parameters instead of accepting bender powders made for solvent slurries.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:56.680
That tuning changes how much active material fits into each cell

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:00.080
and how many cells can be built from a given ton of output.

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:07.600
The CyberCab 48 KWh pack multiplies the effect because the same cathode mass now yields nearly three

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:13.860
times as many vehicles as a heavier truck pack. Vertical integration removes ocean shipping and

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:18.520
and qualifies the material for layered manufacturing credits under the Inflation Reduction Act.

